WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.418
Two words decide whether research

2
00:00:02.418 --> 00:00:03.738
can be trusted.

3
00:00:03.738 --> 00:00:06.126
Reliability and validity.

4
00:00:06.479 --> 00:00:08.492
Reliability means you'd get the

5
00:00:08.492 --> 00:00:10.324
same result if you repeated

6
00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:12.470
it. Validity means it measures

7
00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.601
what it claims to measure.

8
00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:16.373
Quantitative methods,

9
00:00:16.373 --> 00:00:17.339
like surveys,

10
00:00:17.339 --> 00:00:18.967
tend to be reliable.

11
00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:20.167
Qualitative ones,

12
00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:22.099
like participant observation,

13
00:00:22.099 --> 00:00:23.781
tend to be valid.

14
00:00:24.112 --> 00:00:26.946
Malinowski's study of the Trobriand

15
00:00:26.946 --> 00:00:29.931
Islanders, published in 1922,

16
00:00:29.931 --> 00:00:33.119
made participant observation famous.

17
00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:34.731
Your turn.

18
00:00:34.731 --> 00:00:36.629
What do we call that?
